  "termsCloseTooltip": "Close",
  "termsBody": "Welcome to CraveWallet.\n\n1. Purpose of the Service\nCraveWallet is a personal finance application designed to help users track recurring subscriptions and food/delivery expenses, manage monthly delivery budgets, convert currencies (PEN/USD/EUR), and receive reminders before upcoming billing dates.\n\n2. Plans and Payments (CraveWallet Premium)\n- Free Plan: Allows tracking up to 5 active subscriptions and managing delivery expenses.\n- CraveWallet Premium: Costs S/ 9.99 per month (PEN) and unlocks unlimited active subscriptions, monthly and category spending analytics in soles, and the 30-day upcoming charges heatmap.\n- Payment Processing: Premium subscriptions are processed externally through Mercado Pago. CraveWallet does not store your credit/debit card numbers or security codes (CVV); it only receives payment confirmation and membership status from Mercado Pago.\n- Cancellation: You may cancel auto-renewal at any time from the Premium screen and retain access until the end of the paid billing period.\n\n3. Data Stored and Processed\nWe store your account email, encrypted authentication credentials, subscription records (name, amount, currency, billing cycle, next billing date, category, notes), delivery expense records (merchant, amount, category, date, monthly budget), and local session preferences.\n\n4. Device Permissions and Reminders\n- Notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS): Used exclusively when enabled in Reminders to schedule local notifications on your device before each subscription charge.\n- Calendar: Used only when you choose to add upcoming subscription charges to your device calendar.\nYou can revoke these permissions or disable reminders at any time.\n\n5. Ethical Commitment (ACM/IEEE & CIP Principles)\nIn accordance with the ACM/IEEE Software Engineering Code of Ethics and the Colegio de Ingenieros del Perú (CIP) Code of Ethics:\n- Privacy & Confidentiality: We collect only the minimum data required to provide the service.\n- No Sale of Personal Data: CraveWallet never sells, rents, or shares your personal or financial data with third-party advertisers or data brokers.\n- Honesty & Transparency: Exchange rates, totals, and membership charges are presented clearly without hidden fees.\n- Account & Data Deletion: You have the right to request the complete deletion of your account and associated records.\n\n6. Contact\nFor privacy inquiries, support, or account deletion requests, contact us at: [COMPLETAR: correo de contacto]",
